99	149	87	89	the Old Man	20	“ This is Mr. Mig - u - ell Rapponi , boys -- a peeler straight from the Golden Gate . Throw out your war - bag and make yourself to home , Mig - u - ell ; some of the boys'll show you where to bed down . ”
