1109	1128	1129	1129	Cal	9	“ By gosh , a man might do worse than locate that Native Son for a silver mine , ”
1137	1171	1129	1129	Cal	9	“ It 's plumb wicked to ride around with all that wealth and fussy stuff . He must ' a ' robbed a bank and put the money all into a riding outfit . ”
1172	1201	1202	1202	Slim	13	“ By golly , he looks to me like a pair uh trays when he comes bow - leggin ' along with them white diamonds on his legs , ”
